## Usage Example

### Basic Setup

```csharp
// Create container
var container = new ModernRoomCardContainer();
container.Dock = DockStyle.Fill;
this.Controls.Add(container);

// Create sample room
var room = new Room
{
    RoomId = "R001",
    Name = "Phòng 101",
    RoomType = 1,        // 1=Single, 2=Double, 3=Family, 4=VIP, 5=Suite
    Price = 200000,
Status = 0
};

// Add room to container
container.AddRoom(room, RoomStatusType.Available);
```

### Handle Events

```csharp
// Subscribe to events
container.ViewDetailsClicked += (s, room) => 
{
MessageBox.Show($"View details of {room.RoomNumber}");
};

container.BookingClicked += (s, room) => 
{
    MessageBox.Show($"Book room {room.RoomNumber}");
};

container.CleaningClicked += (s, room) => 
{
    MessageBox.Show($"Clean room {room.RoomNumber}");
};
```

### Customize Layout

```csharp
// Set number of columns
container.SetColumnCount(4);

// Set card size
container.SetCardSize(300, 280);

// Add multiple rooms
var rooms = new List<Room> { /* ... */ };
container.AddRooms(rooms, ModernRoomCard.RoomStatus.Available);
```

### Update Status

```csharp
// Change room status
container.UpdateRoomStatus("R001", ModernRoomCard.RoomStatus.Occupied);
```

