### Filtering and Sorting

```csharp
// Clear and reload with filter
_roomContainer.ClearRooms();

var availableRooms = await _roomService.GetAvailableRoomsAsync();
foreach (var room in availableRooms)
{
    _roomContainer.AddRoom(room, ModernRoomCard.RoomStatus.Available);
}
