### Performance Optimization

```csharp
// For large room lists, batch loading
void LoadRoomsInBatches(List<Room> rooms, int batchSize = 10)
{
    for (int i = 0; i < rooms.Count; i += batchSize)
    {
        var batch = rooms.Skip(i).Take(batchSize);
        foreach (var room in batch)
        {
            _roomContainer.AddRoom(room);
        }
        Application.DoEvents();  // Allow UI to update
    }
}
```

